WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
(audience applauds)
- So we were both servers,

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.213
I found out, you were a server as well.

00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:04.330
- Yep.
- I think all of,

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.722
were you a server?
- I was never a server.

00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:07.555
- Oh my God, you're

00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:08.498
the only actor--
- How much do you hate me?

00:00:08.498 --> 00:00:09.500
- I've ever met--
- I know.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.333
- That's never served a table.
- I've never had

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.430
another job.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.280
I know, isn't that bad?
- Oh, that's so great

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.113
for you!
- That's kinda dope.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.161
- That's an awesome, right?
- I envy you, yeah.

00:00:15.161 --> 00:00:17.460
(everyone laughs)
- I feel like I've had

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.620
every job. (laughs)
- Yeah, same.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.290
- I loved serving, actually.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.520
Well, I was a cocktail waitress

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.353
and I felt like I was (fingers
snapping) pretty good at--

00:00:23.353 --> 00:00:24.310
- [Cordae] Where did you serve at?

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.750
- A comedy club.
- Okay, dope.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.830
- Yeah.
- Okay, good vibes,

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.770
good energy.
- Yeah, I know.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.120
- It was happy, it was good.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.980
- Yeah.
- Did you like serving, or no?

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.082
- Absolutely not, oh my God.

00:00:32.082 --> 00:00:33.950
(everyone laughs)

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.783
- Man.
- You didn't?

00:00:34.783 --> 00:00:36.280
I loved my friends I worked with.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.360
I thought it was cool.
- Yeah, it was the restaurant

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.693
I was at, because I
was more than a server.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.350
Sometimes I would have to cook.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.183
If it was dessert--
- Oh.

00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:45.850
- God forbid somebody ordered dessert.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.925
I had to go in the back
and make it myself.

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:48.840
- What?
- For real,

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.640
like the frosting.
- Well, I didn't do that.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.800
- I was my own busser.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.700
I was the bus boy, I had
to bus my own tables.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.280
I had to like scrape the--

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.403
- Was this at your house?
- Where the hell did you work?

